# * balance html output

# ** 1. In tree mode each account cell's class carries its depth, so a
# stylesheet can indent the tree and a UI can fold it (hledger-web does).
<
2025-01-15 a
  assets:bank:checking  10
  assets:cash            5
  income

$ hledger -f- bal --tree -O html
> /<td class="account depth-1"/
>= 0

# ** 2. In list mode, the default, account cells have no depth.
$ hledger -f- bal -O html
> !/depth-/
>= 0
